{"body": "This adds a set method to add custom properties to snapshot summaries. To add a method to all updates that produce snapshots, this adds a new public interface, SnapshotUpdate.\nThe new interface conflicts with a private class, which has been renamed to SnapshotProducer. Similarly, the subclass that implements merging and filter logic has been renamed to MergingSnapshotProducer.", "date": "2019-05-08T16:56:45Z", "hash": "sha256:405c0143efb33f8a9734", "id": "gh:apache/iceberg#180", "meta": {"additions": 105, "base": "master", "closed_at": "2019-05-10T22:46:11Z", "comments": 2, "deletions": 18, "draft": false, "files": ["api/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/AppendFiles.java", "api/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/DeleteFiles.java", "api/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/OverwriteFiles.java", "api/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/ReplacePartitions.java", "api/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/RewriteFiles.java", "api/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/SnapshotUpdate.java", "core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/FastAppend.java", "core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/MergeAppend.java", "core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/MergingSnapshotProducer.java", "core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/OverwriteData.java", "core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/ReplaceFiles.java", "core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/ReplacePartitionsOperation.java", "core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/SnapshotProducer.java", "core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/SnapshotSummary.java", "core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/StreamingDelete.java"], "merged_at": "2019-05-10T22:46:11Z", "merged_by": "rdblue", "n_files": 15, "number": 180, "repo": "apache/iceberg", "reviews": [{"at": "2019-05-10T14:54:48Z", "by": "aokolnychyi", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2019-05-10T15:47:52Z", "by": "rdblue", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2019-05-10T21:25:41Z", "by": "rdblue", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2019-05-10T21:35:57Z", "by": "aokolnychyi", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2019-05-10T21:36:22