{"body": "This PR removes metastore-site.xml as it has no effect.\nThis file is taken into account by MetastoreConf$newMetastoreConf, which is the ONLY config that is printed. However, it is simply used as a basis to create an instance of PersistenceManagerFactory.\nMoreover, parameters set in that file are redundant for Iceberg and belong to Hive ACID.", "date": "2019-05-20T11:14:13Z", "hash": "sha256:3388ad36e081465b292d", "id": "gh:apache/iceberg#190", "meta": {"additions": 0, "base": "master", "closed_at": "2019-05-24T22:30:30Z", "comments": 1, "deletions": 35, "draft": false, "files": ["hive/src/test/resources/metastore-site.xml"], "merged_at": "2019-05-24T22:30:30Z", "merged_by": "rdblue", "n_files": 1, "number": 190, "repo": "apache/iceberg", "reviews": [{"at": "2019-05-21T20:19:14Z", "by": "rdsr", "state": "APPROVED"}], "state": "merged", "thumbs_up": 0, "updated_at": "2019-05-24T22:30:44Z"}, "people": ["aokolnychyi"], "refs": [], "source": "github", "title": "Remove redundant metastore-site.xml from tests", "type": "pr", "url": "https://github.com/apache/iceberg/pull/190"}
{"body": "I had to reopen the file with an ORC reader to get the stripe offsets. Stripe information is cached in the writer but it is not made public AFAICT.  If folks are OK with the approach, I will try to add tests for this, similar to #186\ncc: @edgarRd", "date": "2019-05-21T13:53:58Z", "hash": "sha256:ca689befbaebb943b657", "id": "gh:apache/iceberg#192", "meta": {"additions": 86, "base": "master", "closed_at": "2019-06-06T16:31:14Z", "comments": 8, "deletions": 3, "draft": false, "files": ["orc/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/orc/ORC.java", "orc/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/orc/OrcFileAppender.java", "spark/src/test/java/org/apache/iceberg/spark/data/TestOrcWrite.java"], "merged_at": "2019-06-06T16:31:14Z", "merged_by": "rdblue", "n_files": 3, "number": 192, "repo": "apache/iceberg", "state": "merged", "thumbs_up": 0, "updated_at": "2019-06-06T16:31:38Z"}, "people": ["rdsr"], "refs": [], "source": "github", "title": "Store split offsets for ORC files", "type": "pr", "url": "https://github.com/apache/iceberg/pull/192"}
{"body": "There are a number of things that still need to be addressed and we can create follow up issues for:\n\nDictionaries are part of the Arrow Schema definition, but should be built based off the parquet dictionaries.  This probably means that conversion needs to happen while processing the row group metadata to capture the parquet dictionaries.\n\nThis converts Maps to lists<struct<key,value>>, but that is probably not what is ideal for columnar Spark representation (or other engines).", "date": "2019-05-22T22:19:54Z", "hash": "sha256:efc1e3ecb9226b340167", "id": "gh:apache/iceberg#194", "meta": {"additions": 284, "base": "master", "closed_at": "2019-07-31T22:19:39Z", "comments": 12, "deletions": 7, "draft": false, "files": ["build.gradle", "core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/arrow/ArrowSchemaUtil.java", "core/src/test/java/org/apache/iceberg/arrow/ArrowSchemaUtilTest.java", "versions.lock", "versions.props"], "n_files": 5, "number": 194, "repo": "apache/iceberg", "reviews": [{"at": "2019-06-08T00:57:51Z", "by": "mccheah", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2019-06-08T00:58:24Z", "by": "mccheah", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2019-07-05T04:24:16Z", "by": "danielcweeks", "state": "COMMENTED"}], "state": "closed", "thumbs_up": 0, "updated_at": "2019-07-31T22:19:39Z"}, "people": ["danielcweeks"], "refs": [], "source": "github", "title": "Add basic arrow schema conversion", "type": "pr", "url": "https://github.com/apache/iceberg/pull/194"}
